      "desc:8": "A tower that builds drones and grows with every era. Controller: 2 LV circuits, LV Sensor, 2 LV Motors, LV Hull, 2 LV Robot Arms.\n\n[note]Base:[/note]\n- A round platform of radius 3 made of Solid Steel Machine Casings (hatches go here, at least 30 casings).\n- On it, a 5x5 hangar 3 high: Solid Steel edges, glass in the middle row, an empty 3x3 inside. The controller sits in the middle of the front wall, bottom row.\n\n[note]Each tier adds:[/note]\n- A storey on top of the tower: tier Assembly Frames on the 4 corners with glass between, then a full band of tier Assembly Frames.\n- A landing ring on the ground (platform height): that tier's Landing Pads at radius 4 + 2 x tier from the tower centre, with an Assembly Frame at north, east, south and west.\nLanding Pads: Assembler, 4 plates + 1 frame box of the tier's material -> 8 pads.\nConsecutive storeys = highest drone tier. Hologram Projector: stack size = number of tiers.",
